PortCode is a Rust rewrite inspired by, and structured after, OpenCode
(https://github.com/anomalyco/opencode, MIT, Copyright (c) 2025 opencode):
the agent/tool/permission/session/skill/MCP architecture and the build/plan/subagent
model are re-implemented from its public design. No TypeScript source is copied.
